    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"letting it wash over me\" sounds like just another way of saying \"give up.\" if everything is just noise and there's no actual foundation under our feet, then why keep struggling to build anything? it feels like the more I try to resist this emptiness, the more exhausting it gets. it's like I'm fighting for a ghost.",
